{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019i4CLRq14WAvbdMNrpvcCy","type":"tool_result","content":".pose/specs/2026-11-09-pose-delegate-picker-and-claude-runs.md:25:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/specs/2026-11-09-pose-delegate-picker-and-claude-runs.md:113:- A delegated Claude task on an instance whose policy carries the older Claude profile ends with \"the agent's output could not be redacted; it was not kept\", a message that does not name the profile. The cause inside the redaction path was not isolated; this repository's policy now carries the engine repository's profile, under which Claude tasks complete. It is a follow-up.\n.pose/specs/2026-11-09-pose-delegate-picker-and-claude-runs.md:137:- [open] Name the profile in the failure of a delegated task whose agent output could not be redacted, and find why the older Claude profile produces it. (owner:@pose-maintainers crit:low review:2027-01-08)\n.pose/specs/2026-11-10-pose-delegated-output-redaction-root-cause.md:15:# Spec: Causa raiz do 'agent's output could not be redacted' nas tarefas Claude\n.pose/specs/2026-11-10-pose-delegated-output-redaction-root-cause.md:21:Uma tarefa delegada ao Claude no harne8 não falha mais com 'agent's output could not be redacted', e a falha, quando ocorre, nomeia o perfil e o motivo.\npose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_capture_failure.go:15:\tmessage := fmt.Sprintf(\"the agent's output could not be redacted; it was not kept (agent=%q events=%q stage=%q: %s)\", agent, events, stage, reason)\npose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_task.go:711:\t\t\treturn finish(ReviewRunFailed, \"the run was not started: its argv could not be redacted\")\n.pose/review-runs/rrn-8ee776bb9b38abd2.json:86:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/review-runs/rrn-d3e375c603899bfd.events.ndjson:27:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/review-runs/rrn-8ee776bb9b38abd2.transcript:8:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/review-runs/rrn-d3e375c603899bfd.transcript:84:[Omitted long matching line]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"[private-session]","uuid":"eb63bc31-9a6a-44f4-946f-88dc51f815fd","timestamp":"2026-11-12T17:33:00.766Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":".pose/specs/2026-11-09-pose-delegate-picker-and-claude-runs.md:25:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/specs/2026-11-09-pose-delegate-picker-and-claude-runs.md:113:- A delegated Claude task on an instance whose policy carries the older Claude profile ends with \"the agent's output could not be redacted; it was not kept\", a message that does not name the profile. The cause inside the redaction path was not isolated; this repository's policy now carries the engine repository's profile, under which Claude tasks complete. It is a follow-up.\n.pose/specs/2026-11-09-pose-delegate-picker-and-claude-runs.md:137:- [open] Name the profile in the failure of a delegated task whose agent output could not be redacted, and find why the older Claude profile produces it. (owner:@pose-maintainers crit:low review:2027-01-08)\n.pose/specs/2026-11-10-pose-delegated-output-redaction-root-cause.md:15:# Spec: Causa raiz do 'agent's output could not be redacted' nas tarefas Claude\n.pose/specs/2026-11-10-pose-delegated-output-redaction-root-cause.md:21:Uma tarefa delegada ao Claude no harne8 não falha mais com 'agent's output could not be redacted', e a falha, quando ocorre, nomeia o perfil e o motivo.\npose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_capture_failure.go:15:\tmessage := fmt.Sprintf(\"the agent's output could not be redacted; it was not kept (agent=%q events=%q stage=%q: %s)\", agent, events, stage, reason)\npose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_task.go:711:\t\t\treturn finish(ReviewRunFailed, \"the run was not started: its argv could not be redacted\")\n.pose/review-runs/rrn-8ee776bb9b38abd2.json:86:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/review-runs/rrn-d3e375c603899bfd.events.ndjson:27:[Omitted long matching line]\n.pose/review-runs/rrn-8ee776bb9b38abd2.transcript:8: